<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113579" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρ-αψία</span></b> , ἡ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅπτω</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>violence offered, rough handling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sammelb.
				6152.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hand to hand fight, close combat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειραψίαι καὶ πεζῶν καὶ ἱππέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as a term of wrestling,
				<i>clasping of one's antagonist</i> so as to throw him (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.5
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.234d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>gentle friction, massage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cael.Aur.
				<u>TP</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>; <i>gentle treatment,</i> in operations, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				50.47.1
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
